WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:06,150
Master and disciple are in a hurry to go to Yinghai to snatch the black eagle for the Demon Palace.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,710
I only want to strengthen the Demon Palace, but the old thief Sword Master is holding me back.

3
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:13,390
The disciple Demon Eagle was destroyed. He was no match for him. He was killed.

4
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:17,590
It would be a big mistake to delay the Demon Palace's plan. Please ask your uncle to take action and kill the old thief of the sword master.

5
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:22,550
Damei refuses. This beautiful girl will not help men fight anymore.

6
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:26,070
No, didn't you say there was something you could help me with?

7
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:30,480
Playing with me

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:36,060
You're welcome, seriously.

9
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:44,940
Grandma Duo is going to find that Fuxing man

10
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:47,100
I don’t have time to play house with you.

11
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,420
Is the Blackhawk more important or the man?
